     1086   FUNCTION f-direct RETURNS CHARACTER
     1087   (input  p-rec as recid )  FORWARD.
     1088   FUNCTION mark-string RETURNS CHARACTER
     1089   ( input p-rec as recid , input m as char) FORWARD.
     1090   DEFINE BUTTON b-add
     1091        LABEL "&Добавить":L
     1092        SIZE 9 BY 1 TOOLTIP "Добавить новый заказ".
     1093   DEFINE BUTTON b-chg
